{"v":4,"catch":"在夜空中畫出美麗的星座，把仙女的心握在手中！ ！","desc":"《ITAZURA TENSHI》是《Nichibutsu》於1984年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制一個天使並連接星星以完成星座。\n使用弓可以擊敗擋路的各種敵人。\n當所有星座都完成後，就會出現RAN和LUM。\n讓他們好好擁抱以獲得獎金。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-11-04","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c8d76b70da2e4d2384ab38a3f47632de50e12dc3a8c9ffdc2c373988289434f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b5b0029e1a32f191443728a2396b21d371cbbe3600dbd297f729bcf70627c93d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/12f853f7d8c2d1ab3a4aaa0ba404d2f99a7a4d647dd44174e0861f83c10be56b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90233373b9a21bdc80cc0d8137f0c7a67edbf227125001bc93c2455cef886af5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14894193c66be44771d7539237dd08cdd2bafcfb4d74c6e9774e509ddd295962.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/696be92ce0ed00483d687c7b00fd6919e83d73be5740cdf43efe2035624cf26f.jpg"],"titleId":"01001db0197a2000","dlc":[]}